{"key":"8dc98f34e2427375","source_file":"Potts Sh - So.json","source_id":30313,"source_url":"concordance-skeleton-ppl-sceleton","term":"Skeleton","headwords":["Skeleton"],"latin":["Sceleton"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Skeleton"],"latin":["Sceleton"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","CL","SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"824","subsection":"end"},"text":"Adulterers become like ugly skeletons.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"4533","subsection":"2"},"text":"Some there appear like skeletons.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6348","subsection":"3"},"text":"To angelic sight profaners appear like skeletons, DP 226.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"6959","subsection":"2"},"text":"As such have scarcely any remains, they at last become like skeletons...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"182","subsection":"5"},"text":"Can a bony skeleton... be introduced into a new body?","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"361","subsection":"3"},"text":"Like a skeleton in full dress.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"364","subsection":null},"text":"As to his bones a mere skeleton.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"2644","subsection":null},"text":"They sit... like ugly skeletons. SE 4471.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3705","subsection":null},"text":"Such at last appear like skeletons, with nothing but skin and bones.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3900","subsection":null},"text":"They appear like bony skeletons. DeConj 57.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3912","subsection":"end"},"text":"Antediluvians become as skeletons... SE 3914.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"4503","subsection":null},"text":"Her end was (that she became) a skeleton, not like a common skeleton, but one in which even the bones had wasted into threads. Described. She had been reduced to this state by worms of various kinds.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"5950","subsection":null},"text":"In the light of Heaven (profaners) appear like burnt skeletons. DMin 4740. DMin 4753. AE 233:end. AE 1047:3.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"skeleton","url":"/meta/potts/skeleton/"}